{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"新能源制造业","country":"斯洛伐克","country_iso":"SVK","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:41:24.457093","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"SVK-MF-0001","ldc":"No","location":"苏拉尼","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"斯洛伐克苏拉尼20GWh电池工厂","project_name_en":"Slovakia Surany 20GWh Battery Factory","subcategory":null},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"国轩高科","content":"当地时间10月28日上午，国轩高科位于斯洛伐克苏拉尼（Šurany）市的电池超级工厂项目在斯洛伐克总理罗贝尔特·菲佐（Robert Fico）、副总理兼经济部长丹妮萨·萨科娃（Denisa Saková）、中国驻斯洛伐克大使馆临时代办王小剑及其他中外嘉宾的共同见证下正式启幕。该项目是斯洛伐克历史上第一个超级电池工厂项目，菲佐总理表示，这预示着一个汽车新工业时代的开始。\n斯洛伐克国轩电池超级工厂项目占地65公顷，位于斯洛伐克苏拉尼（Šurany）战略园区，一期规划产能为20GWh，工厂计划2026年试生产，2027年正式生产。产品主要出口到欧盟市场。该项目在第一阶段将为苏拉尼地区带来1300个新工作岗位。","content_sha256":"66cd6843aca996dc4954d77028883ca0058d4897a888c2c5898fe8a5b310ecee","id":1358,"publish_date":"2025-10-31 12:30:23","title":"斯洛伐克国轩电池工厂盛大启幕 菲佐总理见证","title_sha256":"7a4bdbbd9642c371e989d473286d3fe77c3be75ebb2b16d6459d03e18f95df1b","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/89468.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"SVK-MF-0001","capacity_details":"20GWh (一期规划产能)","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:41:24.457185","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"SVK-MF-0001-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://www.stcn.com/article/detail/3461702.html\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":"GWh/年","production_capacity_value":20.0,"project_developer":"国轩高科股份有限公司","project_developer_en":"Gotion","project_stage":"在建","project_summary":"国轩高科在斯洛伐克苏拉尼市建设的电池超级工厂项目已正式启幕。该项目占地65公顷，一期规划产能为20GWh，计划于2026年试生产，2027年正式生产，产品主要出口欧盟市场。","pub